# The pack payload is a BUILD artifact (P2-5): `python tools/build_asset_packs.py build-local`
# copies the mt6989 decoder here from the private artefact store, every byte checked against the
# census's own literals on the way in and re-hashed out of the directory afterwards.
# NeuroPilot-compiled bytecode must never enter a repo with a public remote, and the root
# .gitignore's blob walls do not cover .bin — so this pattern IS the wall.
#
# "Everything in the payload directory EXCEPT the anchor", for the reasons the encoder module's
# .gitignore states: the tracked .gitkeep proves the directory exists in a clean clone, and a
# negation can only re-include a direct child.
src/main/assets/npu_turbo_mt6989_dec/*
!src/main/assets/npu_turbo_mt6989_dec/.gitkeep
